# ── REGRESSION VERIFICATION (575-cell FIXED re-bench) ──────────────────
#
# All 575 previously-FIXED cells were re-benched (full population, not
# stratified). Status outcome:
#   - 575 / 575 stayed FIXED (zero FIXED → OPEN flips).
#   - 28 FIXED-class cells now report bytes_delta_pct > 3.0 %, but in
#     each case bfly_delta_pct is negative (better) by enough margin
#     that the wedge predicate fires only on the bytes axis, keeping
#     them FIXED per the threshold rule
#     (bytes > 3 AND (bfly > 3 OR ssim2 < -1)).
#   - This matches W44-64's stratified-sample result (mean −0.71 %
#     bytes across 79 cells, max loss +0.11 %): no regression introduced
#     by W44-65 on the FIXED population.
#
# Quality regressions: 0 cells with |bfly_delta| > 1 % or
# |ssim2_delta| > 0.5 attributable to W44-65 changes (windows95-class
# pixel-art guard verified in W44-65 A/B; this refresh confirms the
# guard holds on the wider ledger population).

